{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/156156-recruitment-fantasy-nwod-fate-hybrid-eberron-orcs-of-the-demon-wastes-wed-7pm-pst-g-roll20","id":156156,"title":"[Recruitment] Fantasy nWoD/Fate hybrid: Eberron, Orcs of the Demon Wastes Wed 7pm PST G+/Roll20","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-01T19:48:42-07:00","id":156156,"title":"[Recruitment] Fantasy nWoD/Fate hybrid: Eberron, Orcs of the Demon Wastes Wed 7pm PST G+/Roll20","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Character call for an online game. G+/Roll20</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Start with nWoD character creation, with minor skill replacements for fantasy, add aspects and magic templates.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Willpower points will more strongly resemble action point/fate points/bennies, and aspects replace Vice/Virtue</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">First aspect is Demon Wastes Tribes Orc to reflect the base unified background.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">(Survival: Demon Wastes)<br /> Heat Tolerant Merit - 9's explode on stamina rolls related to heat<br /> Allies (Tribe) +++ Merit<br /> Code of Honor Flaw: Orc Tribal</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">+1 Physical Stat at creation<br /> -3 Social to civilized races without Merit: Civilized(+-+++)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">You are each young orcs in the Demon Wastes on the west of Khorvaire. Today you are nearly an adult, about to enter into your initiation. Your parents, mentors, and the shaman and chief of the tribe are indoctrinating you into the blessing of the great triune spirit before sending you out to confront the world, discover who you are, and bring back something of value to the the continuance of the the tribe.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Specific character options available: Warrior, Berserker, Tracker/Hunter, Druidic Shaman Initiate (Spirit Talker/Healer), Skinchanger, Mage Initiate, Witch Woman Initiate, Secret Warlock Initiate, Seer, Barbaric Paladin, Trader/Merchant/Crafter, Herdsman.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I somewhat model the orc tribes on the Aiel of the Wheel of Time series, especially in tone and attitude.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Skills: Remove Firearms, Computer; add Ranged, Warfare, Navigation</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://eberron.wikia.com/wiki/The_Demon_Wastes\" target=\"_blank\">eberron.wikia.com/wiki/The_Demon_Wastes</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> for some background info</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Send email: eberron at soccon dot net</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Read more: <a href=\"http://happyjacks.proboards.com/thread/3388/roll20-nwod-fate-hybrid-eberron#ixzz33RjEysJb\" target=\"_blank\">http://happyjacks.proboards.com/thre...#ixzz33RjEysJb</a></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3171,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3171-plirr","user":"plirr","date":". 06-01-2014, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3171-plirr","name":"plirr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:"